    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、なんだ\r\n新しいバッグか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "違うよ～、そうじゃなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "この間話したでしょ～？\r\nこれ、メイクボックス！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……！\r\nずいぶん立派なやつにしたんだな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか通販したら思ってたより\r\n大きくてびっくりしちゃった～",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、これならまた前みたいに\r\n自分でメイクしなきゃ～って時とかも対応できるし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "透先輩たちに、いつでも\r\nやってあげられるよね～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……ま、持ち歩くのには\r\nちょっと大きいけど～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nでも、いいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのくらいなら俺が持っていくから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、そっか～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー！\r\nお願いします～！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、任せとけ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "じゃあお披露目もしたし、\r\n使いやすいように中身の整理しようかな～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110130"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
