    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n雛菜が興味あるんだったらさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "メイクとか……衣装とかも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分たちでプロデュースしていくのも\r\nいいかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1800
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～！\r\nそれ、すっごく楽しそう～！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どういうものが自分たちに合うかっていうのも\r\nよくわかっていそうだし",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……でも",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "お仕事でメイクさんにしてもらう時\r\nやっぱり上手で、プロだな～って感じるし",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "自分で自分にメイクするのと\r\n人にやってあげるのも、結構違って難しいから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "もしもやるなら\r\nちゃんと練習とか、お勉強しないとかもね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！\r\n練習に勉強か……はは、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～\r\nなんで笑うの～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、すまん\r\nちょっと、意外な単語だったからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そう～～～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\n────あ、そうだ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "じゃあ、早速プロデューサーに\r\n練習台になってもらえばいいのか～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "この間買ったやつも\r\nまだ使ってないから試したいし～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、人にビューラーしてあげるのとか\r\n結構怖いな～って思うから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110250,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサーで練習してもいいでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、それ練習台っていうか\r\n実験台じゃないか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110260,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～、そんなことないよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、雛菜がせっかく\r\nやる気になってるんだし、俺も協力しないとだよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110270,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nそんなに心配しなくても大丈夫だよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006110280,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサーに合う色を使って\r\nちゃんといい感じにしてあげるから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300611/2023006110280"
  },
